    "what": "The District publishes 220 ft (67 m) and records that figure as the permitted midspan clearance. NOAA separately reports 231 ft for the fixed center span and a roughly 12 ft reduction beneath a movable traveler. The model gives 70.390 m to the fixed truss and 66.733 m to a traveler positioned at center; the precise historical basis of the District figure is unspecified.",
